sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant UI as BugConfessionBooth
    participant Redact as secretRedactor
    participant Net as knowledgeService
    participant Server as Node Backend (/api/diagnose)
    participant Orch as AIDebugOrchestrator
    participant Hybrid as HybridSearchEngine
    participant AI as AI Provider (Gemini / OpenAI)
    participant Fallback as Deterministic Fallback Engine

    Dev->>UI: Pastes buggy code & selects language
    Dev->>UI: Clicks "Confess Bug"
    UI->>Redact: scanAndRedactSecrets(code)
    Redact-->>UI: Sanitized code (API keys replaced with [REDACTED])
    UI->>Net: requestBackendDiagnosis(submission)
    
    alt Backend Reachable
        Net->>Server: POST /api/diagnose (payload <= 64KB)
        Server->>Orch: diagnose(submissionContext)
        Orch->>Hybrid: search(query, language, limit=5)
        Hybrid-->>Orch: Retrieved Knowledge Records (BM25 + Dense RRF)
        
        alt Cloud AI Key Available & Valid
            Orch->>AI: generateStructuredDiagnosis(promptWithEvidence)
            AI-->>Orch: Structured JSON (Roast, Fix, Explanation, Citations)
            Orch-->>Server: AIDiagnosisResponse (isGrounded=true, fallback=false)
        else Key Missing or Provider Error
            Orch->>Fallback: assembleDeterministicDiagnosis(retrievedRecords)
            Fallback-->>Orch: Structured Response (usedFallback=true)
            Orch-->>Server: AIDiagnosisResponse (isGrounded=true, fallback=true)
        end
        
        Server-->>Net: HTTP 200 JSON Response
        Net-->>UI: ConfessionResult
    else Backend Unreachable / Cold Start
        Net->>Fallback: Local Stage 4 searchKnowledge fallback
        Fallback-->>Net: Offline Deterministic Result
        Net-->>UI: ConfessionResult (offline mode indicator)
    end

    UI->>Dev: Renders JudgmentTerminal (Roast, Root Cause, Fix Diff, Citations)
    Dev->>UI: Clicks "Verify & Resolve Bug"
    UI->>Dev: Awards +50 XP, triggers audio chime, archives to Bug Graveyard
